  ($qb$HEAIL-ETH-FIB-005$qb$, $qb$A4-02$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$A promise made to end an awkward conversation usually creates a harder ______.$qb$, $qb$one$qb$, $qb$rule$qb$, $qb$delay$qb$, $qb$cost$qb$, $qb$record$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
