  ($qb$HEAIL-DLE-MCQ-017$qb$, $qb$A4-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A report says complaints fell by forty per cent. What should you establish first?$qb$, $qb$How many complaints that actually is$qb$, $qb$Over what period the fall happened$qb$, $qb$Whether the fall is continuing$qb$, $qb$What caused the fall$qb$, $qb$Whether other measures also fell$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
