  ($qb$HEAIL-DLE-MCQ-030$qb$, $qb$A4-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$What is the main risk of using data that is easy to collect?$qb$, $qb$It measures what is countable rather than what matters$qb$, $qb$It may be less accurate than other data$qb$, $qb$It becomes the only thing anyone looks at$qb$, $qb$It is usually out of date by the time it is used$qb$, $qb$It encourages people to collect more of it$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
