  ($qb$HEAIL-DLE-SJT-041$qb$, $qb$A4-06$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You work in a cane weighbridge office. One farmer's loads always weigh in just above the bonus threshold. Others vary widely. How do you approach it?$qb$, $qb$Check how his loads are weighed and by whom$qb$, $qb$Weigh his next load yourself$qb$, $qb$Ask the weighbridge operator about his loads$qb$, $qb$Accuse him of manipulating the weights$qb$, $qb$Leave it, since the loads pass the threshold legitimately$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
