  ($qb$HEAIL-INC-MCQ-018$qb$, $qb$A4-03$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You need to fill a role quickly and know someone suitable. What is the main risk of appointing them directly?$qb$, $qb$Nobody else got the chance to be considered$qb$, $qb$The appointment may be seen as unfair$qb$, $qb$A better candidate might have been available$qb$, $qb$The process was not properly recorded$qb$, $qb$Others may object to the decision$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
