  ($qb$HEAIL-INC-MCQ-034$qb$, $qb$A4-03$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Someone raises a concern about fairness and you believe the decision was sound. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Show them how the decision was reached$qb$, $qb$Explain why the decision was correct$qb$, $qb$Ask what they think went wrong$qb$, $qb$Offer to have someone else review it$qb$, $qb$Confirm that the decision was properly made$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-INC-MCQ-035$qb$, $qb$A4-03$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your team is given a task that requires travel. One member cannot travel easily. What is most useful?$qb$, $qb$Find out which parts genuinely need someone to travel$qb$, $qb$Ask them whether they could manage the travel$qb$, $qb$Give them the parts that do not involve travel$qb$, $qb$Ask another member to take the travel$qb$, $qb$Reallocate the task to someone who can travel$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
