  ($qb$HEAIL-INC-SJT-043$qb$, $qb$A4-03$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You manage an art restoration studio. Your apprentice intake comes entirely from one college because that is where you studied. How do you approach it?$qb$, $qb$Find out where else the skill is taught and advertise there$qb$, $qb$Add a second college to your recruitment$qb$, $qb$Change the selection test to be less college-specific$qb$, $qb$Ask the college to send a wider range of students$qb$, $qb$Continue, since that college produces good apprentices$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
