  ($qb$HEAIL-INC-SJT-047$qb$, $qb$A4-03$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You manage a coin grading service. A grader has a stammer and has stopped speaking in the weekly review meetings, though his written notes are the best in the team. How do you respond?$qb$, $qb$Change the meeting so written contributions count equally$qb$, $qb$Ask him to share his notes at the meeting$qb$, $qb$Read his notes out on his behalf$qb$, $qb$Speak to him about contributing more$qb$, $qb$Leave it, since his written notes are already used$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
