  ($qb$HEAIL-EGO-FIB-017$qb$, $qb$A4-01$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Letting a newer colleague present the work in your place costs you nothing and builds their ______.$qb$, $qb$standing$qb$, $qb$workload$qb$, $qb$hours$qb$, $qb$salary$qb$, $qb$paperwork$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
