  ($qb$HEAIL-EGO-MCQ-020$qb$, $qb$A4-01$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your team succeeded and a senior manager praises you personally. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Name who did what while you have his attention$qb$, $qb$Say that it was a team effort$qb$, $qb$Accept it and tell the team afterwards$qb$, $qb$Say the team deserves the credit$qb$, $qb$Accept it, since you led the work$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-EGO-MCQ-021$qb$, $qb$A4-01$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Someone repeats your idea in a meeting as though it were theirs. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Build on it openly so the thread is visible$qb$, $qb$Say that you had raised the same point$qb$, $qb$Speak to them afterwards about it$qb$, $qb$Let it go, since the idea is being acted on$qb$, $qb$Mention it to whoever chaired the meeting$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-EGO-MCQ-022$qb$, $qb$A4-01$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You are asked in a review what your biggest mistake this year was. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Name a real one and what you changed because of it$qb$, $qb$Name a real one and explain how it happened$qb$, $qb$Name something minor that was quickly corrected$qb$, $qb$Name something that was mostly outside your control$qb$, $qb$Say that nothing significant went wrong$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-EGO-MCQ-023$qb$, $qb$A4-01$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You have been arguing a point for ten minutes and realise you have misunderstood the question. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Say so and ask the other person to start again$qb$, $qb$Say so and let the discussion move on$qb$, $qb$Ask a question that brings the point back into view$qb$, $qb$Adjust your argument so it fits the real question$qb$, $qb$Finish the point you were making and reconsider later$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-EGO-MCQ-024$qb$, $qb$A4-01$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You have been given feedback you think is unfair. What is most useful first?$qb$, $qb$Ask what they saw that led to it$qb$, $qb$Explain why you think it is unfair$qb$, $qb$Ask someone else whether they agree$qb$, $qb$Accept it and consider it later$qb$, $qb$Set out the facts as you understand them$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
